2
00:07:49,565 --> 00:07:55,565
House of Bones is a horror, tv movie film directed by Jeffery Scott Lando.

3
00:11:44,347 --> 00:11:50,347
Psychic Heather Burton and a team of TV ghost hunters travel to investigate a
haunted house surrounded by rumors of paranormal activity.

4
00:15:39,130 --> 00:15:45,130
Heather Burton, played by Charisma Carpenter.

5
00:19:33,913 --> 00:19:39,913
Quentin French, played by Corin Nemec.

6
00:23:28,695 --> 00:23:34,695
Greg Fisher, played by Marcus Lyle Brown.

7
